{"id":"n62061-1-10","stage":0,"title":"근처 · 附近","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62061-1-10-1","ko":"승규 씨는 어디서 살아요?","zh":"承奎，你住在哪里？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎","readings":[{"term":"승규","audio":"/audio/20c7bbd00a1a5f26d499.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"씨는","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살아요?","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b5311e5baf419c0b1cc8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62061-1-10-2","ko":"학교 근처에서 하숙을 해요.","zh":"我在学校附近寄宿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"근처에서","meaning":"附近，近处","explanation":"근처：附近，近处；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"근처","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62061","senseId":"1","lemma":"근처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하숙을","meaning":"寄宿，下宿，借宿","explanation":"하숙：寄宿，下宿，借宿；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"하숙","audio":"/audio/ca97cdfab223556b84be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83962","senseId":"1","lemma":"하숙","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해요.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"e44b07ac25b977cc","term":"근처","zh":"附近，近处","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3","entryId":"62061","definition":"以某场所、东西或人为中心，较近的地方。","pronunciation":["근ː처"]},{"id":"ca97cdfab223556b","term":"하숙","zh":"寄宿，下宿，借宿","audio":"/audio/ca97cdfab223556b84be.mp3","entryId":"83962","definition":"交房租和伙食费而在别人家里吃住；或指那样的人家。","pronunciation":["하ː숙"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/69fc2e0244eff8ee383c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.477,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62061","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":16,"sequenceScore":0.7159,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我在学校附近寄宿。","承奎，你住在哪里？","真的可以相信你的话吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["承奎，你住在哪里？","真的可以相信你的话吗？","我在学校附近寄宿。"],"answer":2}]}
